    exact allCenters_plane_gu h hp hp2 hq4 κ hH hXE (hBE t) hrE hr1 (hB1 t) (hBr t) (hXB t)
      hζ hζN (hBX t) hXp hlamN hB₁ hB₂ (ha l) (hb l') hab (hρζ c₁) (hρζ c₂)
